{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》今晚（27日）驚現世紀彩蛋！現年52歲的車婉婉，竟在劇中驚喜復刻20多年前的經典角色「萬貴妃」，造型一出即時勾起觀眾集體回憶。當她重遇當年戲服時，更因發現一個塵封多年的秘密而感觸落淚，究竟這件戲服背後隱藏著甚麼動人故事？\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情大暴走 車婉婉樊亦敏古裝鬥省鏡</h2>\n<p>在今晚播出的「喜來我家」單元中，劇情講述龔喜（樊亦敏飾）因受傷而暫住嘉冰（車婉婉飾）家中，樂天的龔喜將及時行樂的性格感染給嘉冰，令她變成購物狂，引發連場笑料。劇情高潮落在二人齊齊換上古裝，55歲的樊亦敏繼中秋後再度扮演嫦娥，而52歲的車婉婉則重現了她在經典劇集《皆大歡喜》中的「萬貴妃」造型。雖然二人均已年過半百，但穿上古裝後依然明艷照人，風采不減當年，視覺年齡彷彿只有30多歲。對比20多年前的劇照，如今的車婉婉褪去了青澀，更添一份成熟女人味，絕對是逆齡生長的代表！</p>\n<h2>車婉婉感動剖白：諗都冇諗過</h2>\n<p>相隔超過20年再度以「萬貴妃」示人，車婉婉坦言心情非常激動，更沒想過有此機會。她受訪時感動表示：「其實真係諗都冇諗過20幾年後會做番萬貴妃，呢套係當年少不更事嘅婉婉第一套戲服，公司都仲Keep得好好。」最讓她驚喜的是，當她拿起戲服時，發現上面依然保留著當年的標籤，她激動地說：「見到件衫仲寫住『車婉婉皆大歡喜 T1』，係好難得嘅回憶，製造都製造唔到出嚟。」這個小小的標籤，瞬間將她拉回當年的拍攝時光，讓她感觸良多。</p>\n<h2>車婉婉重遇20年前幕後功臣 感激一句超暖心</h2>\n<p>除了戲服帶來驚喜，更讓車婉婉感動的是與幕後功臣的重逢。她透露，今次為她梳理「萬貴妃」髮型的，正是20多年前同一位髮型師「燕姐」。她憶述：「同埋廿幾年前幫我梳呢個頭嘅燕姐，今次都係佢幫我梳番個頭，令我哋喺清水灣電視城嘅回憶一下子返晒嚟，我就覺得好感動。」車婉婉更分享當年「燕姐」的敬業精神：「以前成套《皆大歡喜》頭飾嘅一粒一珠，都係佢自己釘㗎。」被問到戲服尺寸是否合身時，她幽默回應：「居然完全唔需要修改，原來生完同未生，我個人都係差唔多厚同闊嘅。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚：回憶返晒嚟！</h2>\n<p>劇集預告一出，車婉婉的「萬貴妃」造型隨即在網上引爆熱議，網民紛紛留言洗版，大讚是「回憶殺」。不少觀眾表示：「嘩！萬貴妃！真係回憶返晒嚟！」「婉婉完全冇變過，仲靚咗，更加有女人味！」「呢啲先係真正嘅彩蛋，TVB好有心！」「聽到佢講返件戲服嘅故仔，真係好感動，感受到佢對工作嘅熱愛。」「52歲仲keep得咁好，太屈機喇！」「今晚一定要準時睇，支持婉婉！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01_2901023086ae03a08d29ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01_2901023086ae03a08d29ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_12678260546ae03a0eabae9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_12678260546ae03a0eabae9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_3598672966ae03a1214802.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_3598672966ae03a1214802.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_12884187416ae03a180109a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_12884187416ae03a180109a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_16098426086ae03a1e48b29.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_16098426086ae03a1e48b29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11c_2635781356ae03a2804070.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11c_2635781356ae03a2804070.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11b_5164746506ae03a2a8762f.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11b_5164746506ae03a2a8762f.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11a_9339816746ae03a2cc8d18.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11a_9339816746ae03a2cc8d18.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_21405341956ae03a2fc7144.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_21405341956ae03a2fc7144.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_2491138406ae03a331edb7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_2491138406ae03a331edb7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_11244637276ae03a3659ae6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_11244637276ae03a3659ae6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_18072716976ae03a3943c29.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_18072716976ae03a3943c29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5343446656ae03a3c7bccc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5343446656ae03a3c7bccc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:52.354856+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1398,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:52.598026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:49.883162+00:00","content_hash":"12b88e686fef3d7a711f1c44a479fbf6213175399dbedccb3b9d1f462679e460","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}